   {
    "id": "6415b1a7-6fd1-4bdf-8dd8-cc916aa60d19",
    "quote": "A fantastic entry to the series. Easily the best gears since 3. The new movement system is great, weapons feel punchy, gore is crunchy/chunky, horde is a blast, and PVP is solid. The story (while it plays safe for the most part IMO) is decently written and its paired with incredible set pieces. Their are a few slow down areas which do take you out of the action for a little while but I didn't really mind them. Overall a fantastic game though.",
