   {
    "id": "b2a3adcb-cfae-4bde-a640-54dfe3496abf",
    "quote": "If you love the old Gears of wars you will love this one. Campaign brings it back to 4 player coop with your buddies like it was in Gears of War 3. Multi-player feels like Gears of war 1. Horde is fun and different. I would like classic horde were it is 1 threw 50 waves. But I can see them adding that later. ",
